window.products.push({"id":656173,"name":"Rug Gripper, 12PCS, Non Slip Rug Pad for Area Rugs, Non Skid Reusable Rug Tape, Rug Corners Grippers for Hardwood Floors, Tile and Wall, Keeping Your ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717AAOsgfPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to USE: 1. Keep the carpet back and floor clean. 2. The hook surface affixed to the back of the carpet, the other side attached to the floor, after the press, you can play a fixed role to prevent sliding. 3. If you need to clean the carpet, separated from the hook surface and rough surface can be. 4. More use: Not only to prevent the rug sliding on floor or carpet, but also Fixed Outlet or Fixed Router. CAUTION: Keep away from Children and Pets. OTHER TIPS: A. Keep the ground(floor) and the back of the carpet flat, clean and dry before use. The contact surface is rough, with water, oil or dust will affect the paste effect. B. After the use of products damp, please promptly clean, dry environment favorable to extend the service life. (Long time humid environment, will accelerate the aging of the glue, loss of sticky, affecting the use of results.) C. Applicable temperature range :(14-140℉)/(10-60 ℃) Too low temperature will affect the viscosity, too high temperature glue will melt. D. How to clean up when you do not need it: With a soft cloth dip alcohol or soapy water, and then gently wipe the paste site, the product will become easy to fall off the glue.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717AAOsgfPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GDLCYYDS","source_asin":"B0B1ZVBVY7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1ZVBVY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1ZVBVY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":656174,"name":"Water Heated Mattress Pad Twin Size 39\" x 75\", Smart Water Heating System Works with Alexa, iOS & Android, Soft & Comfort Quilted Heated Mattress Unde","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VZ5F+q3TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Revolutionary Water Heating System] – The water heating system circulates water through a soft and comfortable mattress pad to bring your bed ideal sleeping temperature. Benefit from Precise Temperature Control technology, our water heating system can maintain your bedding temperature at ±1℉, keeping you warm and comfortable throughout the night. [Safe, Safe and Safe] – Nothing is important than safety for you and your family. MERRY HOME water heating system eliminates 100% of the risks associated with traditional electric blankets. Water and electricity is completely separated, in addition, it is equipped with 5 level EMD Protection System to avoid any possible injury. [30% Energy Saving] – With advanced power management and high convert efficiency, our water heating system can save 30% more electricity than traditional electric blankets. We adopted new mute technology for the high flow water pump, caring your comfortable sleep every night. [Voice & APP Control in Smart Home] – Works with Alexa & phone APP, allows you to control this smart light hand-free with simple voice commands. With the “Cloud Intelligents” App on your phone, you can easily turn on/off, set temperature, create timers and so much more functions as long as the machine connected to WIFI. [Softy and Comfy Pads] – The mattress pad is made of double-layer super soft fleece surface filled with whole piece foam and internal tubing system that is both discrete and durable. Quilted square pattern is simple but elegant, available in Twin, Queen and King sizes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VZ5F+q3TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAOK","source_asin":"B08LQDJ4LG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656174","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LQDJ4LG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LQDJ4LG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
