window.products.push({"id":656203,"name":"YM Love Set - Coffee Mug and Greeting Card. Iconic LOVE Sculpture with Funny Saying - from New York's Hit Character","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YHllQaFHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brighten up your morning coffee or afternoon tea with this perfectly witty YM Love mug - with the iconic LOVE sculpture by Robert Indiana. Dishwasher and microwave safe. 11-ounce (325ml) capacity. The YM Love Greeting Card is the perfect addition to our YM Love set. Vertical folded 5.62” x 7.87” single card and envelope. Satin finish. Meet the creator: By award winning author Alan Strozenberg, who turned his mom's absurd comments into comedy gold - as featured on the New York Post. Meet the YM Character: A witty, genuine, warm-hearted mother who invites you to celebrate the humor and love of all mothers. Based on true stories.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YHllQaFHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YM","source_asin":"B07GRMG4KM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656203","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GRMG4KM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GRMG4KM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
