window.products.push({"id":656215,"name":"Flojery 4pcs Artificial Succulents Plants with Pot Mini Realistic Fake Succulents Ceramic Planter for Desk, Office, Living Room, and Home Decoration (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q5Zsc9IvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The mini artificial succulent plants are designed for home and office decoration. Perfect for living room, bedroom, kitchen, wall,bookshelf, desk, wedding,counter or any other places you want to add vitality. The fake succulent potted plants with vivid color and exquisite workmanship for realistic looking and gives you a realistic feeling when you touch them.Approximate Dimensions (each pots, in inches): 1.9W X 3.15 H X 1.94D. Premium quality non-toxic TPE material made leaves,soil and ceramic pots for safe.They are eco-friendly, safe for human and pets, and will remain fresh-looking and beautiful for a long time. They are very easy to maintain, you don’t need to water them or take care of them constantly. Perfect for those who love succulents but don’t know how or have no time to take care of them. GUARANTEED--If you are unsatisfied with our product for any reason, return it for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q5Zsc9IvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flojery","source_asin":"B07Q1BD8ZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q1BD8ZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q1BD8ZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":656216,"name":"Cozyholy Duvet Cover Set Queen Size Navy Blue Reversible Botanical Leaves Soft Microfiber Bedding Cover Set with Zipper Colsure and Corner Ties","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VZDt0N2kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cozy home, cozy day. Choose Cozyholy, choose a better life. ·Our vision is to make your sleeping more comfortable, make your life better. ·For us, everyone is unique, every night is important. Why need a duvet cover set? -Duvet cover sets offer a simple way to experiment with the look of your bedroom while providing a protective outer layer for your duvet. -They come in different sizes and styles and are usually machine washable. This makes them ideal for guest rooms, or for those who don't want to wash the entire duvet every week. -Additionally, switching up the duvet cover set is a great way to regulate the temperature of your bedding, as you can experiment with different materials for every season. -The versatility and easy maintenance of duvet cover certainly makes them a bedding essential. Why choose Cozyholy duvet cover sets? -Made from 100% microfiber polyester, the duvet cover set is warm, cozy, and perfect for all seasons. -Zipper closures keep your duvet insert or comforter snugly tucked away, while four corner ties keep it from shifting around within the cover. -The matching pillowcases feature the same series of patterns for an elegant look. -If you're looking for an inexpensive way to add your personality to a room, pick them then. Features - Pattern Style: Reversible bedding set. From boho leaves to royal damask - Size: Twin (duvet cover x1, pillowcase x 1), Queen (duvet cover x 1, pillowcases x 2), King (duvet cover x 1, pillowcases x 2) - Colors: Dark grey leaves, navy blue leaves, royal damask, black floral, grey grid Care Instruction - Machine wash in cold water. Gentle cycle. Tumble dry low. Great Gift - It is a great gift for family, friends on Thanksgiving, Christmas, Valentines' Day, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91VZDt0N2kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozyholy","source_asin":"B07H31B1JR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H31B1JR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H31B1JR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":656217,"name":"Root Candles Boutique 20-Hour Votive Candles, Victorian Fantasy, 4-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VF1s90DcL._AC_.jpg","description":"Root's Votive Candles use only the finest blend of waxes for a clean burn that lasts up to 20-hour. Essential oil enhanced fragrance produces a lasting sensory experience. Choose from a variety of colors and fragrances. Each oversized votive candle is individually wrapped and labeled. Keep a couple of boxes on hand and you'll always have a lovely gift. Since 1869, Root Candles of Medina, Ohio, has been an industry-leading, family-owned company renowned for innovative ideas, aesthetic enhancements and the highest standards of quality. Now in its fifth generation, the Root family continues to extol the virtues of honesty, integrity, and diligent craftsmanship. These qualities were exemplified by Root Candles founding father and American original, Amos Ives Root. His tradition of excellence, along with a genuine commitment to customer satisfaction and service, defines and fuels Root's strong brand loyalty today. Root Candles devotion to purity, honesty and quality is renowned. Each Root candle is carefully handcrafted using processes mastered through five generations of craftsmanship combined with the latest in manufacturing technologies. The results are pure and simple: Root Candles are highly regarded for complex bouquets of subtle fragrances and sophisticated color palettes, important factors for discerning candle lovers. Today, Root Candles can confidently lay claim to making \"the best candles in America.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41VF1s90DcL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Root Candles","source_asin":"B005K4O9AS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005K4O9AS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005K4O9AS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":656218,"name":"Carstens Southwest Harvest 5 Piece Cotton Printed Quilt Bedding Set, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Y4ZbMikLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tap into the mysterious magic of a Southwest harvest! this bedding collection celebrates the blessings of the earth and the constancy of the seasons. Shades of blue typify life-living water and endless sky, accented by maize gold and castilleja crimson. The quilt's crisp lines and recurring native American motifs pay homage to the timeless wisdom of the ancient ones. Harmonize with coordinating pillows and shams, and your heart will rejoice in your Southwest harvest","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Y4ZbMikLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carstens, Inc.","source_asin":"B01MT8M359","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MT8M359","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MT8M359","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
