window.products.push({"id":656227,"name":"Six Scents Romantic Collection Butterfly Series - US Handmade Highly Scented Soy Wax Melts Set Of 6 - Colors Vary.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RzGki4yGL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wedding Day, Endlessly In Love, Love Spell, Passionate Kisses, Lucky In Love & Unconditional Love. Six uniquely themed soy tart melts scented with popular fragrances. These are made with 100% pure soy wax. They are hand poured into molds and highly scented with high quality fragrance oil. Just place one tart or two in your wax/tart melter and you'll enjoy the scent that you love from a candle without an open flame. 6 Scented unique wax melts are individually packed in clear boxes Try these exciting new fragrance and feel the love in the air. Colors may vary. Dimensions per box: 3\"X3\"X2\" Weight: 2 oz (approx) BurnTime: 10+ hours WEDDING DAY - A romantic complex fragrance oil with top notes of pears, and apricots; middle notes of rose, orchids, birds of paradise; with bottom notes of fresh English Ivy, sandalwood, and musk. ENDLESSLY IN LOVE - is a green fruity floral bouquet with apple, rose and jasmine top notes with a sweet woodsy musky background. PASSIONATE KISSES - this fragrance begins with top notes of raspberry, blackberry and fresh strawberries. Followed by mid notes of coconut milk and freshly picked roses. Ending bottom notes of Egyptian vanilla and amber musk. LOVE SPELL - a fruity citrus fragrance with top notes of grapefruit, apples, strawberries, and clementines; middle notes of peach, black currant, chamomile and cherry blossom, with a sweet white musky base note. LUCKY IN LOVE - a lovestruck burst of citruses, peaches, berries and melons highlight this feminine favorite, in a bed of musk. UNCONDITIONAL LOVE - top notes of black currant & citrus notes; middle notes of Jasmine and Lily; base notes of Vanilla and Musk.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RzGki4yGL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ai Made","source_asin":"B01DYQI28I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DYQI28I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DYQI28I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
