window.products.push({"id":656371,"name":"Immersion Blender LINKChef 4-in-1 Hand Blender Stick Powerful Low Noise Large 800ml Beaker, Stainless Steel Whisk and 500ml Food Chopper, BPA-Free, Re","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Eo9SjaCjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's easy to have a healthy life!  What we want to do is to make your life more simple and healthy. You can make fruit and vegetable juices, milkshakes, smoothies, baby food supplement and much more in a short period of time. You will find blending easier than ever with this LINKChef Smart Stick immersion blender. Pick it up to blend cold drinks, hot soups, and sauces batte– right in the pitcher, pot or bowl. It's comfortable to hold, easy to use, the blending shaft and attachments are dishwasher-safe. Enjoy it! Built-in 300 Watts of power that instantly blend and crush your healthy ingredients in no time and turn them into the healthiest and the most delicious meals created in your own home. Powerful motor that easily adjusts and creates a perfect texture and consistency of your blended meals and drinks. Comfortable and ergonomically designed body with rubberized handle make it easy to grip and comfortable blending. Built-in Package Included: - Powerful low noise 300-Watt motor;  - Ergonomically designed grip and rubberized handle; - Robust titanium coating stainless steel ice crushing blades; - Dishwasher-safe and BPA-free attachments; - Special ice crushing blade added. Includes: - Immersion blender main body;  - Stainless steel mixing stick;  - Stainless steel whisk attachments;  - 500ml food processor/ chopper with 1* stainless steel blades, 1* ice crushing blade;  - 800ml BPA-free beaker with coaster/cup cover;  - User manual. Caution: - Do not immerse the motor unit in water;  - Blades are sharp. Handle carefully;  - Please read the user manual carefully before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Eo9SjaCjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINKChef","source_asin":"B07F3Q2NRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F3Q2NRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F3Q2NRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
