window.products.push({"id":656465,"name":"Pop Chart A Visual Compendium of Typewriters Poster Print, 18\" x 24\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gjnXFl+mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A throwback to the original word processor, this chart features over 60 beautiful hand-illustrations of some of the greatest typewriters from antiquity to recent history. Underscoring over 100 years of essential models from the first Hammond in 1870 to the Remington Rands and Smith Coronas of the 20th century, these marvelous contraptions are arrayed in ribbons of compositional innovation. Perfect for those that love ligatures, laud legendary laureates, and lament the loss of the carriage return, this print is truly something to write home about. Printed on 100lb archival stock and packaged in a Pop Chart Lab Test Tube.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gjnXFl+mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pop Chart Lab","source_asin":"B00WAWTU3Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WAWTU3Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WAWTU3Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
