window.products.push({"id":656485,"name":"Groomsmen Gifts Set of 3, Groomsmen Tumblers Personalized w/ Engraved Names & Title, 20 or 30 Oz, 3 Colors, Double Wall Stainless Steel Insulated Tumb","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810nRCX4+zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Personalized Groomsmen Proposal Gift: Our personalized groomsmen tumblers are a great gift choice to ask your best friends to be your groomsmen on your wedding day. The tumblers are uniquely customized with names, titles, initials, and your wedding date. Whether you want a best man gift, a groomsman gift, a gift for your usher or father of the bride, you can depend on our groomsmen tumbler to impress your friends with its chic customizations. High-Quality Tumblers: Our customized groomsmen tumblers are made from durable food-grade stainless steel with double-wall insulation which makes a vacuum seal that preserve the temperature of hot and cold drinks for a long time. Moreover, the exterior layer is sweat-free, preventing any condensation, which makes the tumbler easy to carry and slip-resistant. Fits most cup holders due to its sleek design. Comes with Spill-Free Sliding-Closure Lid. Available in 2 Sizes,3 Colors & 3 Set Options: You can choose one of our 2 available capacity sizes, 20 ounces or 30 ounces. You can also choose one of our 3 elegant colors. Cardinal Red, Black, or Navy Blue. In addition, since our personalized groomsmen tumbler is available in 3 set options; Single, Set of 3 & Set of 6, you can make sure every groomsman will get one! Easy Customization: After choosing the set option and the design you liked the most from our listing, you can click \" CUSTOMIZE NOW \" and choose the size and color of the tumbler or set of tumblers you want. Then you can submit the customization details for the design by filling the lines with initial(s), name(s) &/ last name(s), and date. Please Note: Please make sure when customizing sets that the names and titles are written in the same sequence since the first provided name and title will be on one tumbler, the second name & title will be on the second tumbler, and so on...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810nRCX4+zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UNITED CRAFT SUPPLIES","source_asin":"B09TT9BQ8F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TT9BQ8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TT9BQ8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
