window.products.push({"id":656601,"name":"LIFEREVO Luxury Faux Fur Bedding Set Rabbit Hair Duvet Cover Set Large Pompoms Decorative, Zipper Closure (Twin, Dark Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715qtt2+t9L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"10mm high pile faux rabbit fur on front side, ultra soft crystal velvet mink on back side for both duvet cover and pillowcases. Antistatic, wrinkle, fade and pilling resistant. Twin:1 pc duvet cover 66\"x90\" and 1 pc pillow shams 20\"x26\". Queen: 1 pc duvet cover 90\"x90\" and 2 pcs pillow shams 20\"x26\". King:1 pc duvet cover 104\"x90\" and 2 pcs pillow shams 20\"x36\". Little white pompoms around pillowcases and four big balls on the corner of the quilt cover, stylish and cute. Solid modern colors match with any bedroom decors. Enjoy the softness and warmth of this decorative plush faux fur bedding when under during chilly days and nights. Hidden zipper design easy to separate and launder, four corner ties inside for better keep the duvet insert in place. Machine wash cold on gentle cycle. Tumble dry low or dry flat. Do not bleach. Do not Iron. Turn inside-out to avoid damaging big pompoms. We suggest washing before first use as it sheds a bit for produce cutting. LIFEREVO appreciate you love our products like our other 5-star reviewers that we offer a 30-day return and replacement service. If you have any questions, please contact us to get a satisfied solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715qtt2+t9L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFEREVO","source_asin":"B07R7PG19J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R7PG19J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R7PG19J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
