window.products.push({"id":656744,"name":"Silicone Oven Mitts Set, Kupadio Extra Long Non-Slip Heat Resistant 450℉Oven Gloves with 2 Hot Pads Potholders and 2 Basting Brush for Kitchen Baking ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817SDqOBFQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Versatility Cooking Set For Your Kitchen & Grill – Our silicone oven mitts set comes with 2 long insulated oven gloves, 2 silicone hot pads and 2 basting pastry brush. Perfect for baking, cooking or handling other hot items indoor or outdoor. The potholders also can be used as mats, drying mat, spoon holder and coaster, etc. The soft and flexible silicone bristles work great on meats, pastries, cakes, desserts and more! All they are essential kitchen, camping and picnic accessories. Heat-resistant & Long Enough Gloves - KUPADIO oven mitt made of food-grade silicone (BPA free) with excellent heat resistance, can withstand temperatures up to 230°C!. Even using them near flames, they will not catch fire or melt. Besides, it measure 15 inches long, and have a higher stretch on the arm than other oven mitts, completely protect your hands and arms from injury. Better Anti-slip & Waterproof Performance - The silicone oven glove and pot holders for kitchen designed with unique texture pattern can help you tighten your grip on pots, pans, and baking pans, ensure your object would not slip from your hands and reduce the risk of accidents. Compared with a fabric oven mitt, these silicone oven mitts are entirely waterproof and impermeable. No longer worry about the steam from hot food hurting your hands. Easy Clean & Store - Silicon oven gloves are stain-resistant and easily cleanable. Simply toss them in the dishwasher or rinse them with water! After cleaning, the BBQ gloves are as new as ever. With proper care, the cooking set certainly last for a long time. With loops design on the chuffs, You can hang them near the grill or on any hook, making your kitchen countertop more clean and tidy. 100% Satisfaction Service & Ideal Gift - All these cooking sets packaged in a bag, please check it as you received the product. We focus highly on product quality and value the shopping experience of our customers. Whenever you have a question, please feel free to contact us! It would be a great gift for family or friends who like to bake or cook.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817SDqOBFQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kupadio","source_asin":"B091HL31N9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091HL31N9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091HL31N9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
