window.products.push({"id":656775,"name":"Inflatable Travel Pillows for Airplane, Blow Up Neck Pillow for Sleeping, Airplane Travel Essentials for Long Flight Support Head, Neck and Lumbar, Us","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y-UTXEFLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multifunctional accessories: This inflatable travel pillow is the beginning of a long journey or a nap in the office. Your waist, head, neck, and shoulders no longer feel uncomfortable, just choose your favorite posture to relax and maintain a good sleep and nap. You can also watch movies or play games on your phone in your pillow Get rid of pain and bad posture: Poor posture can cause cervical damage and damage the sciatic nerve and coccyx. According to reasonable ergonomic principles, we define the neck pillow as a pillow that not only wraps around the neck, but also maintains the correct relationship between the head, neck and shoulders during sleep. This inflatable travel neck pillow can help you avoid injury and insomnia. Atmospheric valve: Compared with ordinary inflatable pillows, the inflatable traveling pillow uses a unique large air valve, which makes it easier to inflate and deflate. (It is not recommended to fill the air too full, leave some space, the aircraft neck pillow will be softer.) It's like sleeping on feathers: these travel pillows are made of pvc flocking, and the surface material is soft to the touch and can touch your face very good Ideal for frequent travelers: The small package is very light and can be easily fixed to the suitcase. This is the best choice for long-distance flights and short-distance buses or trains, and you can also use it in a car or office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y-UTXEFLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Povinmos","source_asin":"B0B6VL3553","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656775","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6VL3553","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6VL3553","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
