window.products.push({"id":656826,"name":"Get Custom Art Ivan Konstantinovich Aivazovsky - The Ninth Wave, Canvas Art Print Wall Decor - Size 24x36 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yOUzHMKmL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Make any wall a masterpiece Whether you’re creating a stylish conversation space or an eye-catching focal point in your foyer, this tasteful print is sure to garner compliments from even the most discerning art aficionado. We use top-of-the-line Giclee printers and premium archival inks to attain rich, dramatic imagery. If you love classic paintings or are enamored by bright colors and vivid depictions, then this print will be a valuable addition to your home or office. We represent excellence in printmaking Giclee is an advanced process for creating high-quality fine art productions. Our canvas prints are printed on a thick quality canvas with a 2” border, with the option to add a gallery wrap service using 0.75” stretcher bars. Our poster prints are printed on a thick satin photo paper. Superior archival inks achieve the most vivid colors and resolutions possible. Gallery wrapped canvas prints are ready-to-hang, or will fit perfectly into a frame. Our family-owned and operated printmaking shop allows us to pay particular attention to every customer, order, and inquiry. Most orders ship within 2-3 days. With a diverse collection of designs to choose from, your home decorating possibilities are limitless. Committed to Customer Satisfaction We love art and we thrive on the feedback and satisfaction of our customers. We use only the highest quality materials and processes to bring you magnificent wall art for the home and office. In the event that our product does not meet your expectations, Please reach out to us for assistance or you can choose to return within 30 days. Decorate your walls without breaking the bank. Add this stunning Wall Art Print to your cart today. Note: Depending on the size you choose, some cropping may be involved to save the integrity of the print","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yOUzHMKmL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Get Custom Art","source_asin":"B01LZ6QZ5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-656826","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZ6QZ5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZ6QZ5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
